        "source": "// Property lookup chain benchmark (prototype chain depth)\nvar N = 3200000;\n\n// Deep prototype chain\nfunction A() { this.a = 1; }\nfunction B() { this.b = 2; }\nfunction C() { this.c = 3; }\nfunction D() { this.d = 4; }\nfunction E() { this.e = 5; }\n\nB.prototype = new A();\nC.prototype = new B();\nD.prototype = new C();\nE.prototype = new D();\n\nvar obj = new E();\n\n// Lookup own property\nvar sum = 0;\nfor (var i = 0; i < N; i++) { sum += obj.e; }\n\n// Lookup from prototype chain (depth 1)\nfor (var i = 0; i < N; i++) { sum += obj.d; }\n\n// Lookup from prototype chain (depth 2)\nfor (var i = 0; i < N; i++) { sum += obj.c; }\n\n// Lookup from prototype chain (depth 3)\nfor (var i = 0; i < N; i++) { sum += obj.b; }\n\n// Lookup from prototype chain (depth 4)\nfor (var i = 0; i < N; i++) { sum += obj.a; }\n\nprint(sum);\n",
        "source_sha256": "d3d3d3aa8660b1df0c129def6dd2a4d2c48ad01e7fe07d71efb664150b52a1ab"
